### Keyword search - single token match
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/conversations/search/keyword?query=electric&page=0&size=5

### Keyword search - phrase match (plainto_tsquery handles tokenization)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/conversations/search/keyword?query=electric%20toothbrush&size=10

### Keyword search - no results expected (unknown token, no tsvector match)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/conversations/search/keyword?query=quantumcryptography

### Keyword search - missing query param should return 400
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/conversations/search/keyword
